### Array Validation and Defensive Programming

When validating the `source_artifacts` array field from the amendment payload, we should explicitly verify that it is indeed an array. If the field is present but is not an array, we should process it as an empty array and trigger a validation failure to ensure the system fails closed.

```suggestion
  const status = amendment.upstream_status ?? upstreamStatus(inputs);
  if (amendment.source_artifacts !== undefined && amendment.source_artifacts !== null && !Array.isArray(amendment.source_artifacts)) {
    errors.push('source_artifacts_must_be_an_array');
  }
  const sourceArtifacts = Array.isArray(amendment.source_artifacts) ? amendment.source_artifacts : [];
```

